-- ella-langley-seven-grammy-nominations-big-four-20261117 (news; English 564 words; Nepali 522 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'ella-langley-seven-grammy-nominations-big-four-20261117', 'news', 'USA',
'Ella Langley Earns Seven Grammy Nominations in All Four Major Categories',
'Ella Langley ले चारै प्रमुख विधामा सात Grammy नामांकन पाइन्',
'Ella Langley earned seven nominations for the 2027 Grammy Awards, including Album of the Year, Record of the Year, Song of the Year and Best New Artist. She is the first country artist in 58 years to be nominated in all four major categories in the same year.',
'Ella Langley ले २०२७ Grammy Awards का लागि सात नामांकन पाइन्, जसमा Album of the Year, Record of the Year, Song of the Year र Best New Artist समावेश छन्। उनी एउटै वर्ष चारै प्रमुख विधामा नामांकन पाउने ५८ वर्षयताकी पहिलो कन्ट्री कलाकार हुन्।',
$$<p>Ella Langley earned seven nominations for the 2027 Grammy Awards, including Album of the Year, Record of the Year, Song of the Year and Best New Artist. She is the first country artist in 58 years to be nominated in all four of the awards' biggest categories in the same year, a feat last achieved by Bobbie Gentry in 1968.</p><p>The nominations were announced on Monday 16 November, and Langley goes into the 60th CMA Awards on Wednesday 18 November leading the field with nine nominations, including Entertainer of the Year. Her hit single "Choosin Texas" has spent a record run at No. 1 on the Billboard Hot 100.</p><h2>Ella Langley at a glance</h2><table><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Information</th></tr><tr><td>Grammy nominations</td><td>7, for the 69th Grammy Awards</td></tr><tr><td>Big Four</td><td>Album, Record, Song of the Year, Best New Artist</td></tr><tr><td>Album of the Year</td><td>Dandelion</td></tr><tr><td>Record and Song of the Year</td><td>"Choosin Texas"</td></tr><tr><td>Hot 100 No. 1 run</td><td>27 weeks, a record (Billboard)</td></tr><tr><td>CMA Awards</td><td>9 nominations, leads the field, Wednesday 18 November</td></tr><tr><td>Grammy ceremony</td><td>Sunday 7 February 2027, Crypto.com Arena, Los Angeles</td></tr></table><h2>What happened</h2><p>Langley, 27, picked up nominations for Album of the Year for Dandelion, Record of the Year and Song of the Year for "Choosin Texas", and Best New Artist, plus three more in country categories. According to Billboard, she is only the 17th artist ever to earn nominations in each of the Big Four categories in a single year, and 13 of those 17 are women.</p><p>The nominations put her among the most-nominated artists of the year. RAYE leads the field with 11 nominations, followed by Rosalia with nine, while Langley, Miranda Lambert, Olivia Rodrigo and Phoebe Bridgers each have seven. Women earned seven of the eight Album of the Year nominations, and Billboard reports it is the first time the six most-nominated artists were all women.</p><p>"Choosin Texas", co-written by Lambert, has become the longest-running No. 1 song in Billboard Hot 100 history. The Tennessean reports it could make Langley the first country artist to win Record of the Year in more than 15 years.</p><h2>Why the Ella Langley nominations matter</h2><p>Country music has waited nearly six decades for another artist to sweep the Big Four nominations, and Langley did it in the same year her single broke the Hot 100 record. The nominations also cap a breakout year in which she took home seven wins at the Academy of Country Music Awards and became the only country artist nominated in all four major Grammy categories.</p><p>The CMA Awards on Wednesday will be an early test of her momentum. Langley leads the nominations there with nine, including Entertainer of the Year against Luke Combs, Cody Johnson, Chris Stapleton and host Lainey Wilson, and she is scheduled to perform. The ceremony will also pay tribute to Dolly Parton, who received three posthumous Grammy nominations.</p><h2>What is not confirmed</h2><p>No winners have been decided. Final-round Grammy voting takes place between 10 December and 7 January, and the ceremony is on 7 February 2027, so the nominations are a shortlist, not a result.</p><p>One figure differs by outlet: Billboard reporting puts the "Choosin Texas" run at No. 1 on the Hot 100 at 27 weeks, while the Tennessean puts it at 28 weeks, as the chart week rolled over after the nominations were announced. The record itself is not in doubt, only the exact count at the time of writing.</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Coverage: Billboard, via PressBee, 17 November 2026; Parade, 16 November 2026; The Tennessean, 16 November 2026; Country Music UK, 16 November 2026; Stereogum, 16 November 2026.</p>$$,
$$<p>Ella Langley ले २०२७ Grammy Awards का लागि सात नामांकन पाइन्, जसमा Album of the Year, Record of the Year, Song of the Year र Best New Artist समावेश छन्। उनी एउटै वर्ष पुरस्कारका चारै ठूला विधामा नामांकन पाउने ५८ वर्षयताकी पहिली कन्ट्री कलाकार हुन्, यो उपलब्धि अन्तिम पटक Bobbie Gentry ले १९६८ मा हासिल गरेकी थिइन्।</p><p>नामांकन सोमबार १६ नोभेम्बरमा घोषणा गरियो, र Langley बुधबार १८ नोभेम्बरमा हुने ६०औँ CMA Awards मा Entertainer of the Year सहित नौ नामांकनका साथ अग्रस्थानमा छिन्। उनको हिट गीत "Choosin Texas" Billboard Hot 100 मा नम्बर १ मा रेकर्ड समयसम्म रह्यो।</p><h2>Ella Langley एक नजरमा</h2><table><tr><th>विवरण</th><th>जानकारी</th></tr><tr><td>Grammy नामांकन</td><td>७, ६९औँ Grammy Awards का लागि</td></tr><tr><td>चार ठूला विधा</td><td>Album, Record, Song of the Year, Best New Artist</td></tr><tr><td>Album of the Year</td><td>Dandelion</td></tr><tr><td>Record र Song of the Year</td><td>"Choosin Texas"</td></tr><tr><td>Hot 100 नम्बर १</td><td>२७ हप्ता, रेकर्ड (Billboard)</td></tr><tr><td>CMA Awards</td><td>९ नामांकन, अग्रस्थान, बुधबार १८ नोभेम्बर</td></tr><tr><td>Grammy समारोह</td><td>आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७, Crypto.com Arena, लस एन्जलस</td></tr></table><h2>के भयो</h2><p>२७ वर्षीया Langley ले Dandelion का लागि Album of the Year, "Choosin Texas" का लागि Record of the Year र Song of the Year, र Best New Artist का लागि नामांकन पाइन्, साथै कन्ट्री विधामा थप तीन नामांकन। Billboard अनुसार उनी एउटै वर्ष चारै ठूला विधामा नामांकन पाउने इतिहासकी १७औँ कलाकार मात्र हुन्, र ती १७ मध्ये १३ महिला हुन्।</p><p>नामांकनले उनलाई वर्षका सबैभन्दा बढी नामांकन पाउने कलाकारमध्ये राखेको छ। RAYE ११ नामांकनका साथ अग्रस्थानमा छिन्, त्यसपछि Rosalia का नौ छन्, भने Langley, Miranda Lambert, Olivia Rodrigo र Phoebe Bridgers का प्रत्येक सात छन्। महिलाहरूले Album of the Year का आठमध्ये सात नामांकन पाए, र Billboard ले पहिलो पटक सबैभन्दा बढी नामांकन पाउने छ कलाकार सबै महिला भएको रिपोर्ट गरेको छ।</p><p>Lambert द्वारा सह-लेखिएको "Choosin Texas" Billboard Hot 100 इतिहासमा सबैभन्दा लामो समय नम्बर १ मा रहेको गीत बनेको छ। The Tennessean ले यो गीतले Langley लाई १५ वर्षभन्दा बढी समयपछि Record of the Year जित्ने पहिलो कन्ट्री कलाकार बनाउन सक्ने रिपोर्ट गरेको छ।</p><h2>Ella Langley नामांकन किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ</h2><p>कन्ट्री संगीतले अर्को कलाकारले चारै ठूला नामांकन पाउन झन्डै छ दशक कुर्नुपर्‍यो, र Langley ले त्यो त्यही वर्ष गरिन् जस वर्ष उनको गीतले Hot 100 रेकर्ड तोड्यो। नामांकनले उनको उदयमान वर्षलाई शिखरमा पुर्‍याएको छ, जसमा उनले Academy of Country Music Awards मा सात पुरस्कार जितिन् र चारै प्रमुख Grammy विधामा नामांकन पाउने एक मात्र कन्ट्री कलाकार बनिन्।</p><p>बुधबारको CMA Awards उनको गतिको प्रारम्भिक परीक्षण हुनेछ। Langley त्यहाँ नौ नामांकनका साथ अग्रस्थानमा छिन्, जसमा Luke Combs, Cody Johnson, Chris Stapleton र होस्ट Lainey Wilson विरुद्ध Entertainer of the Year समावेश छ, र उनी प्रस्तुति दिने तालिका छ। समारोहले Dolly Parton लाई पनि श्रद्धाञ्जलि दिनेछ, जसले तीन मरणोपरान्त Grammy नामांकन पाएकी छन्।</p><h2>के पुष्टि भएको छैन</h2><p>कुनै विजेता तय भएका छैनन्। Grammy को अन्तिम चरणको मतदान १० डिसेम्बरदेखि ७ जनवरीबीच हुन्छ, र समारोह ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७ मा छ, त्यसैले नामांकन छोटो सूची हो, नतिजा होइन।</p><p>एउटा आँकडा स्रोत अनुसार फरक छ: Billboard को रिपोर्टले "Choosin Texas" को Hot 100 नम्बर १ मा रहेको अवधि २७ हप्ता भनेको छ, भने The Tennessean ले नामांकन घोषणा भएपछि चार्ट हप्ता फेरिएकाले २८ हप्ता भनेको छ। रेकर्डमाथि शंका छैन, लेख्दाको समयमा ठ्याक्कै गणना मात्र फरक छ।</p><h2>स्रोतहरू</h2><p>रिपोर्ट: Billboard, PressBee मार्फत, १७ नोभेम्बर २०२६; Parade, १६ नोभेम्बर २०२६; The Tennessean, १६ नोभेम्बर २०२६; Country Music UK, १६ नोभेम्बर २०२६; Stereogum, १६ नोभेम्बर २०२६।</p>$$,
