-- raye-leads-grammy-nominations-2027-eleven-20261117 (pop-music; English 730 words; Nepali 586 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'raye-leads-grammy-nominations-2027-eleven-20261117', 'pop-music', 'UK',
'RAYE Leads Grammy Nominations 2027 With 11 Nods and Ties Beyoncé Record',
'रेयले २०२७ ग्र्यामी नामांकनमा ११ नोड्ससहित अग्रता लिइन् र बियोन्सेको रेकर्ड बराबर गरिन्',
'RAYE leads the 2027 Grammy nominations with 11 nods, the most of any artist this year, and ties Beyoncé record for the most nominations in a single year by a woman artist.',
'रेयले २०२७ ग्र्यामी नामांकनमा ११ नोड्ससहित सबै कलाकारभन्दा अगाडि रहिन् र एकै वर्षमा महिला कलाकारले पाएको सबैभन्दा धेरै नामांकनको बियोन्सेको रेकर्ड बराबर गरिन्।',
$$<p>RAYE leads the 2027 Grammy nominations with 11 nods, more than any other artist this year, after the Recording Academy announced the nominees for the 69th Grammy Awards on Monday 16 November 2026. Her album <i>This Music May Contain Hope.</i> is up for Album of the Year, and her hit “Where Is My Husband!” is nominated for Record of the Year, Song of the Year and Best Pop Solo Performance. <a href="https://www.lanacion.com.ar/usa/raye-leads-2027-grammy-nominations-followed-by-rosalia-ella-langley-olivia-rodrigo-and-more-nid16112026/">Associated Press</a> reports that the 11 nominations tie the record Beyoncé set at the 2025 Grammys for the most nominations in a single year by a woman artist.</p><p>It is the first time RAYE has been nominated in the three biggest general-field categories, and she is also up for Songwriter of the Year, Non-Classical, a prize that recognises the writers behind the songs. She has 15 Grammy nominations across her career and is still waiting for her first competitive win.</p><h2>RAYE Grammy nominations 2027 at a glance</h2><table><tr><th>Detail</th><th>What we know</th></tr><tr><td>Nominations</td><td>11, the most of any artist at the 2027 Grammys</td></tr><tr><td>Album of the Year</td><td>This Music May Contain Hope.</td></tr><tr><td>Record of the Year</td><td>“Where Is My Husband!”</td></tr><tr><td>Song of the Year</td><td>“Where Is My Husband!”</td></tr><tr><td>Best Pop Solo Performance</td><td>“Where Is My Husband!”</td></tr><tr><td>Best Pop Vocal Album</td><td>This Music May Contain Hope.</td></tr><tr><td>Songwriter of the Year</td><td>Non-Classical</td></tr><tr><td>Also nominated</td><td>Best Traditional Pop Vocal Performance, Best Pop Duo/Group Performance, Best Dance Pop Recording, Best Music Video</td></tr><tr><td>Record tied</td><td>Beyoncé, 11 nominations in a single year by a woman artist (2025)</td></tr><tr><td>Career nominations</td><td>15, with no competitive win yet</td></tr><tr><td>Ceremony</td><td>Sunday 7 February 2027, Crypto.com Arena, Los Angeles, on ABC, Disney+ and Hulu</td></tr></table><h2>What happened</h2><p>The Recording Academy announced the nominations on Monday morning, 16 November, across 100 categories. RAYE topped the list, ahead of Rosalía on nine nominations and a group on seven each, including Ella Langley, Miranda Lambert, Olivia Rodrigo and Phoebe Bridgers. Seven of the eight Album of the Year nominees are women, with Bruno Mars the only male solo artist in the field.</p><p>RAYE built her year on <i>This Music May Contain Hope.</i>, her second album, and on “Where Is My Husband!”, a genre-mixing hit that travelled from the pop charts to social media feeds. The song is one of only a few tracks nominated in all three of Record of the Year, Song of the Year and Best Pop Solo Performance. Her Songwriter of the Year nomination puts her craft, not just her voice, in front of the voters.</p><h2>Why it matters</h2><p>Women dominate the top of the 2027 nominations in a way the Grammys have not seen before, claiming the top six places on the nominations list. RAYE leading the field, and tying a Beyoncé record in the process, is the clearest sign of that shift. She arrived at the nominations as a songwriter first, an independent artist who rebuilt her career after leaving her major label, and the nominations reward that longer road.</p><p>The Album of the Year race now sets up a contest between RAYE and a field that includes Taylor Swift, Rosalía, Olivia Rodrigo, Phoebe Bridgers, Ella Langley, Olivia Dean and Bruno Mars. RAYE has never won a Grammy, so a win in any of the big three categories would be a first, and a win for Album of the Year would make her the first British woman to take the prize in years.</p><h2>How to watch</h2><p>The 69th Grammy Awards take place on Sunday 7 February 2027 at Crypto.com Arena in Los Angeles, airing live at 7 p.m. Eastern on ABC for the first time since 1972, and streaming on Disney+ and Hulu. Final-round voting, when the roughly 16,000 Recording Academy members choose the winners, runs from 10 December 2026 to 7 January 2027. Only recordings released in the United States between 31 August 2025 and 28 August 2026 were eligible.</p><h2>What is not decided yet</h2><p>No winner is decided until the February ceremony, and nominations are not wins. RAYE faces Taylor Swift, Rosalía and Olivia Rodrigo in Album of the Year, and “Where Is My Husband!” faces seven other songs in both Record and Song of the Year. Whether the voters reward a breakthrough year or a veteran campaign will only be known on the night.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> Associated Press via La Nación, “Raye leads 2027 Grammy nominations, followed by Rosalía, Ella Langley, Olivia Rodrigo and more”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.lanacion.com.ar/usa/raye-leads-2027-grammy-nominations-followed-by-rosalia-ella-langley-olivia-rodrigo-and-more-nid16112026/ ; Grammy.com, “Who Has The Most Nominations At The 2027 Grammys?”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.grammy.com/news/who-has-the-most-grammy-nominations-at-the-2027-grammys/ ; Reuters via GMA News, “Raye and Rosalia lead nominations for Grammys 2027”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/showbiz/showbizabroad/1009717/raye-and-rosalia-lead-nominations-for-grammys-2027/story/?just_in</p>$$,
$$<p>रेकर्डिङ एकेडेमीले सोमबार १६ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा ६९औँ ग्र्यामी अवार्डका लागि नामांकन घोषणा गरेपछि रेयले २०२७ ग्र्यामी नामांकनमा ११ नोड्ससहित सबै कलाकारभन्दा अगाडि रहिन्। उनको एल्बम <i>This Music May Contain Hope.</i> एल्बम अफ द इयरका लागि मनोनित छ भने उनको हिट गीत “Where Is My Husband!” रेकर्ड अफ द इयर, सङ अफ द इयर र बेस्ट पप सोलो पर्फर्मेन्सका लागि मनोनित छ। <a href="https://www.lanacion.com.ar/usa/raye-leads-2027-grammy-nominations-followed-by-rosalia-ella-langley-olivia-rodrigo-and-more-nid16112026/">एसोसिएटेड प्रेस</a> का अनुसार यी ११ नामांकनले एकै वर्षमा महिला कलाकारले पाएको सबैभन्दा धेरै नामांकनको बियोन्सेको रेकर्ड बराबर गरेको छ, जुन बियोन्सेले २०२५ ग्र्यामीमा बनाएकी थिइन्।</p><p>रेय पहिलो पटक तीनवटै ठूला सामान्य विधाका पुरस्कारका लागि मनोनित भएकी हुन्। उनी सङराइटर अफ द इयर, नन-क्लासिकलका लागि पनि मनोनित छिन्, जुन गीत पछाडिका लेखकहरूलाई दिइने पुरस्कार हो। उनको करियरमा जम्मा १५ ग्र्यामी नामांकन भइसकेका छन् र उनले अझै प्रतिस्पर्धात्मक पुरस्कार जितेकी छैनन्।</p><h2>एक नजरमा</h2><table><tr><th>विवरण</th><th>हामीलाई के थाहा छ</th></tr><tr><td>नामांकन</td><td>११, २०२७ ग्र्यामीमा कुनै पनि कलाकारको सबैभन्दा धेरै</td></tr><tr><td>एल्बम अफ द इयर</td><td>This Music May Contain Hope.</td></tr><tr><td>रेकर्ड अफ द इयर</td><td>“Where Is My Husband!”</td></tr><tr><td>सङ अफ द इयर</td><td>“Where Is My Husband!”</td></tr><tr><td>बेस्ट पप सोलो पर्फर्मेन्स</td><td>“Where Is My Husband!”</td></tr><tr><td>बेस्ट पप भोकल एल्बम</td><td>This Music May Contain Hope.</td></tr><tr><td>सङराइटर अफ द इयर</td><td>नन-क्लासिकल</td></tr><tr><td>बराबर गरेको रेकर्ड</td><td>बियोन्से, एकै वर्षमा महिला कलाकारको ११ नामांकन (२०२५)</td></tr><tr><td>करियर नामांकन</td><td>१५, अझै जित्न बाँकी</td></tr><tr><td>समारोह</td><td>आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७, क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिना, लस एन्जलस, ABC, Disney+ र Hulu मा</td></tr></table><h2>के भयो</h2><p>रेकर्डिङ एकेडेमीले सोमबार बिहान १६ नोभेम्बरमा १०० विधामा नामांकन घोषणा गर्यो। रेय सबैभन्दा अगाडि रहिन्, त्यसपछि रोजालिया ९ नामांकनसहित दोस्रो स्थानमा रहिन् र एला ल्याङ्ली, मिरान्डा ल्याम्बर्ट, ओलिभिया रोड्रिगो र फोबी ब्रिजर्स ७-७ नामांकनसहित पछि रहे। एल्बम अफ द इयरका आठ उम्मेदवारमध्ये सात महिला छन्, ब्रुनो मार्स मात्र एक्ला पुरुष एकल कलाकार हुन्।</p><p>रेयले यो वर्ष आफ्नो दोस्रो एल्बम <i>This Music May Contain Hope.</i> र “Where Is My Husband!” गीतबाट बनाएकी हुन्, जुन पप चार्टबाट सामाजिक सञ्जालसम्म पुगेको हिट हो। यो गीत रेकर्ड अफ द इयर, सङ अफ द इयर र बेस्ट पप सोलो पर्फर्मेन्स तीनवटैमा मनोनित हुने थोरै गीतमध्ये एक हो।</p><h2>यो किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ</h2><p>२०२७ को नामांकनको शीर्ष स्थानमा महिलाहरूले यसअघि कहिल्यै नदेखिएको प्रभुत्व जमाएका छन्, नामांकन सूचीका शीर्ष छ स्थान महिलाहरूले ओगटेका छन्। रेयको अग्रता र बियोन्सेको रेकर्ड बराबरीले त्यो परिवर्तनलाई स्पष्ट देखाउँछ। उनी पहिले गीतकारका रूपमा चिनिएकी थिइन्, प्रमुख लेबलबाट अलग भएपछि स्वतन्त्र कलाकारका रूपमा करियर पुनर्निर्माण गरेकी थिइन्, र यी नामांकनले त्यो लामो यात्रालाई मान्यता दिएका छन्।</p><p>एल्बम अफ द इयरको दौडमा अब रेय, टेलर स्विफ्ट, रोजालिया, ओलिभिया रोड्रिगो, फोबी ब्रिजर्स, एला ल्याङ्ली, ओलिभिया डिन र ब्रुनो मार्सबीच प्रतिस्पर्धा हुनेछ। रेयले कहिल्यै ग्र्यामी जितेकी छैनन्, त्यसैले ठूला तीन विधामध्ये कुनैमा जिते पनि त्यो उनको पहिलो जित हुनेछ।</p><h2>कसरी हेर्ने</h2><p>६९औँ ग्र्यामी अवार्ड आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७ मा लस एन्जलसको क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिनामा हुनेछ र १९७२ पछि पहिलो पटक ABC मा प्रत्यक्ष प्रसारण हुनेछ, साथै Disney+ र Hulu मा स्ट्रिम हुनेछ। अन्तिम चरणको मतदान १० डिसेम्बर २०२६ देखि ७ जनवरी २०२७ सम्म चल्नेछ, जसमा करिब १६,००० रेकर्डिङ एकेडेमी सदस्यहरूले विजेता छान्नेछन्। ३१ अगस्ट २०२५ देखि २८ अगस्ट २०२६ बीच अमेरिकामा रिलिज भएका रेकर्डिङ मात्र योग्य थिए।</p><h2>के पुष्टि भएको छैन</h2><p>फेब्रुअरीको समारोह नभएसम्म कुनै विजेता तय हुँदैन, र नामांकन जित होइन। एल्बम अफ द इयरमा रेयले टेलर स्विफ्ट, रोजालिया र ओलिभिया रोड्रिगोसँग प्रतिस्पर्धा गर्नुपर्नेछ, र “Where Is My Husband!” ले रेकर्ड र सङ अफ द इयर दुवैमा सात अन्य गीतसँग प्रतिस्पर्धा गर्नेछ। मतदाताहरूले नयाँ कलाकारलाई पुरस्कृत गर्छन् वा अनुभवी अभियानलाई, त्यो समारोहको रात मात्र थाहा हुनेछ।</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> Associated Press via La Nación, “Raye leads 2027 Grammy nominations, followed by Rosalía, Ella Langley, Olivia Rodrigo and more”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.lanacion.com.ar/usa/raye-leads-2027-grammy-nominations-followed-by-rosalia-ella-langley-olivia-rodrigo-and-more-nid16112026/ ; Grammy.com, “Who Has The Most Nominations At The 2027 Grammys?”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.grammy.com/news/who-has-the-most-grammy-nominations-at-the-2027-grammys/ ; Reuters via GMA News, “Raye and Rosalia lead nominations for Grammys 2027”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/showbiz/showbizabroad/1009717/raye-and-rosalia-lead-nominations-for-grammys-2027/story/?just_in</p>$$,
