-- beyonce-100-grammy-nominations-first-artist-20261117 (pop-music; English 633 words; Nepali 527 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'beyonce-100-grammy-nominations-first-artist-20261117', 'pop-music', 'USA',
'Beyoncé Reaches 100 Grammy Nominations as First Artist Ever to Hit the Mark',
'बियोन्से १०० ग्र्यामी नामांकन पुग्ने पहिलो कलाकार बनिन्',
'Beyoncé has become the first artist in history to reach 100 Grammy nominations, with her 2027 nod for Morning Dew (Donk) taking her career tally to a century.',
'बियोन्से ग्र्यामी इतिहासमा १०० नामांकन पुग्ने पहिलो कलाकार बनेकी छन्, २०२७ को Morning Dew (Donk) नामांकनसँगै उनको करियरको संख्या एक शतक पुगेको छ।',
$$<p>Beyoncé has become the first artist in history to reach 100 Grammy nominations. Her single nomination at the 2027 Grammys, for “Morning Dew (Donk)” in Best R&B Solo Performance, takes her career tally to 100, extending a record she already held as the most-nominated artist in Grammy history. <a href="https://www.grammy.com/news/who-has-the-most-grammy-nominations-at-the-2027-grammys/">Grammy.com</a> confirms the milestone, noting she is also the most-awarded artist ever, with 35 wins.</p><p>The 100th nomination arrives on a quiet year by her standards. She has no album in the running, because she released no album inside the eligibility window, and “Morning Dew (Donk)” is her only nomination this year. That single nod was still enough to carry her past a mark no artist had ever reached.</p><h2>Beyoncé 100 Grammy nominations at a glance</h2><table><tr><th>Detail</th><th>What we know</th></tr><tr><td>Career nominations</td><td>100, the first artist ever to reach the mark</td></tr><tr><td>2027 nomination</td><td>Best R&B Solo Performance, “Morning Dew (Donk)”</td></tr><tr><td>Career wins</td><td>35, the most Grammy wins by any artist</td></tr><tr><td>Previous tally</td><td>99 nominations through the 2025 ceremony</td></tr><tr><td>Song released</td><td>4 July 2026, part of the B’Day 20th anniversary deluxe edition</td></tr><tr><td>Category rivals</td><td>Kehlani, Victoria Monét, Jill Scott, Tems</td></tr><tr><td>Most-nominated since</td><td>2024, when she passed Jay-Z on 88 nominations</td></tr><tr><td>Ceremony</td><td>Sunday 7 February 2027, Crypto.com Arena, Los Angeles, on ABC, Disney+ and Hulu</td></tr></table><h2>What happened</h2><p>The Recording Academy announced the 2027 Grammy nominations on Monday 16 November 2026. Beyoncé earned one nomination, for “Morning Dew (Donk)”, a previously unreleased track that arrived on 4 July as part of the rollout for the 20th anniversary deluxe edition of her second album, <i>B’Day</i>. The nomination is her 100th, and the Academy confirmed she is the first artist to reach the number.</p><p>She came close two years ago. Her <i>Cowboy Carter</i> era carried her to 99 nominations through the 2025 ceremony, when the album earned 11 nominations in a single year. This year she had no new album in the eligibility window, which ran from 31 August 2025 to 28 August 2026, so a single song nomination had to do the work, and it did.</p><h2>Why it matters</h2><p>One hundred nominations is a record about longevity as much as popularity. Beyoncé has been nominated in every decade of her solo career, across pop, R&B, country and dance, and she has won 35 times, more than any artist in Grammy history. The 100th nod also lands in the same year that RAYE tied her record of 11 nominations in a single year by a woman artist, which ties the two records together: Beyoncé set the single-year mark in 2025, and now owns the career mark outright.</p><p>The nomination also keeps her in the story of the 2027 ceremony even without an album in contention. A win in February would be her 36th Grammy, extending the wins record she already holds, and it would come for a song that was not even on an album when it was first released.</p><h2>How to watch</h2><p>The 69th Grammy Awards take place on Sunday 7 February 2027 at Crypto.com Arena in Los Angeles, airing live at 7 p.m. Eastern on ABC and streaming on Disney+ and Hulu. Final-round voting runs from 10 December 2026 to 7 January 2027. In Best R&B Solo Performance, “Morning Dew (Donk)” competes against Kehlani and “Out the Window”, Victoria Monét and “Let Me”, Jill Scott and “Pressha”, and Tems and “What You Need”.</p><h2>What is not decided yet</h2><p>The nomination is confirmed, but the win is not. Beyoncé has lost far more often than she has won at the Grammys, and this category is a straight contest between five strong R&B performances. Whether the voters mark the 100th nomination with a trophy will be known only on 7 February.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> Grammy.com, “Who Has The Most Nominations At The 2027 Grammys?”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.grammy.com/news/who-has-the-most-grammy-nominations-at-the-2027-grammys/ ; Parade, “Beyoncé Makes Grammy History With 100th Career Nomination”, 16 November 2026 — https://parade.com/news/beyonce-makes-grammy-history-with-100th-career-nomination ; IOL, “Beyoncé makes Grammy history as first artist to reach 100 nominations”, 16 November 2026 — https://iol.co.za/entertainment/celebrity-news/2026-11-16-beyonc-makes-grammy-history-as-first-artist-to-reach-100-nominations/</p>$$,
$$<p>बियोन्से इतिहासमा १०० ग्र्यामी नामांकन पुग्ने पहिलो कलाकार बनेकी छन्। २०२७ ग्र्यामीमा उनको एक मात्र नामांकन, बेस्ट आर एन्ड बी सोलो पर्फर्मेन्समा “Morning Dew (Donk)” गीतका लागि, सँगै उनको करियरको संख्या १०० पुगेको छ, जसले ग्र्यामी इतिहासमा सबैभन्दा धेरै नामांकन पाएको कलाकारको रूपमा उनको रेकर्डलाई अझ बलियो बनाएको छ। <a href="https://www.grammy.com/news/who-has-the-most-grammy-nominations-at-the-2027-grammys/">Grammy.com</a> ले यो उपलब्धि पुष्टि गरेको छ र उनी ३५ जितसहित सबैभन्दा धेरै पुरस्कार जित्ने कलाकार पनि हुन् भनी उल्लेख गरेको छ।</p><p>१००औँ नामांकन उनको मापदण्डमा शान्त वर्षमा आएको हो। योग्यता अवधिभित्र उनले कुनै एल्बम रिलिज गरेकी थिइनन्, त्यसैले “Morning Dew (Donk)” उनको यो वर्षको एक मात्र नामांकन हो। त्यो एउटै नामांकनले उनलाई कुनै कलाकारले कहिल्यै नपुगेको संख्यामा पुर्यायो।</p><h2>एक नजरमा</h2><table><tr><th>विवरण</th><th>हामीलाई के थाहा छ</th></tr><tr><td>करियर नामांकन</td><td>१००, यो संख्या पुग्ने पहिलो कलाकार</td></tr><tr><td>२०२७ नामांकन</td><td>बेस्ट आर एन्ड बी सोलो पर्फर्मेन्स, “Morning Dew (Donk)”</td></tr><tr><td>करियर जित</td><td>३५, कुनै पनि कलाकारको सबैभन्दा धेरै ग्र्यामी जित</td></tr><tr><td>अघिल्लो संख्या</td><td>२०२५ समारोहसम्म ९९ नामांकन</td></tr><tr><td>गीत रिलिज</td><td>४ जुलाई २०२६, B’Day २०औँ वार्षिकोत्सव डिलक्स संस्करणको भाग</td></tr><tr><td>विधाका प्रतिस्पर्धी</td><td>केहलानी, भिक्टोरिया मोने, जिल स्कट, टेम्स</td></tr><tr><td>समारोह</td><td>आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७, क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिना, लस एन्जलस, ABC, Disney+ र Hulu मा</td></tr></table><h2>के भयो</h2><p>रेकर्डिङ एकेडेमीले सोमबार १६ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा २०२७ ग्र्यामी नामांकन घोषणा गर्यो। बियोन्सेले “Morning Dew (Donk)” गीतका लागि एउटा नामांकन पाइन्, जुन गीत ४ जुलाईमा उनको दोस्रो एल्बम <i>B’Day</i> को २०औँ वार्षिकोत्सव डिलक्स संस्करणको भागका रूपमा आएको थियो। यो नामांकन उनको १००औँ हो र एकेडेमीले उनी यो संख्या पुग्ने पहिलो कलाकार भएको पुष्टि गरेको छ।</p><p>उनी दुई वर्षअघि नै नजिक पुगेकी थिइन्। उनको <i>Cowboy Carter</i> युगले उनलाई २०२५ समारोहसम्म ९९ नामांकनमा पुर्याएको थियो, जुन वर्ष एल्बमले एकै वर्षमा ११ नामांकन पाएको थियो। यो वर्ष योग्यता अवधिमा उनको कुनै नयाँ एल्बम थिएन, त्यसैले एउटा गीतको नामांकनले काम गर्नुपर्यो, र त्यसले गर्यो।</p><h2>यो किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ</h2><p>एक सय नामांकन लोकप्रियताजत्तिकै लामो करियरको रेकर्ड हो। बियोन्से आफ्नो एकल करियरको हरेक दशकमा पप, आर एन्ड बी, कन्ट्री र डान्स विधामा मनोनित भएकी छन् र ३५ पटक जितेकी छन्, जुन ग्र्यामी इतिहासमा कुनै पनि कलाकारको सबैभन्दा धेरै हो। १००औँ नामांकन त्यही वर्ष आएको छ जुन वर्ष रेयले एकै वर्षमा महिला कलाकारको ११ नामांकनको बियोन्सेको रेकर्ड बराबर गरिन्।</p><p>यो नामांकनले एल्बम प्रतिस्पर्धामा नभए पनि उनलाई २०२७ समारोहको कथामा राखेको छ। फेब्रुअरीमा जितेमा त्यो उनको ३६औँ ग्र्यामी हुनेछ, जसले उनको जितको रेकर्डलाई अझ बढाउनेछ, र त्यो जित त्यस्तो गीतका लागि हुनेछ जुन पहिलो पटक रिलिज हुँदा कुनै एल्बममा थिएन।</p><h2>कसरी हेर्ने</h2><p>६९औँ ग्र्यामी अवार्ड आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७ मा लस एन्जलसको क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिनामा हुनेछ र ABC मा प्रत्यक्ष प्रसारण हुनेछ, साथै Disney+ र Hulu मा स्ट्रिम हुनेछ। अन्तिम चरणको मतदान १० डिसेम्बर २०२६ देखि ७ जनवरी २०२७ सम्म चल्नेछ। बेस्ट आर एन्ड बी सोलो पर्फर्मेन्समा “Morning Dew (Donk)” ले केहलानीको “Out the Window”, भिक्टोरिया मोनेको “Let Me”, जिल स्कटको “Pressha” र टेम्सको “What You Need” सँग प्रतिस्पर्धा गर्नेछ।</p><h2>के पुष्टि भएको छैन</h2><p>नामांकन पुष्टि भएको छ, तर जित पुष्टि भएको छैन। बियोन्सेले ग्र्यामीमा जितेभन्दा धेरै पटक हारेकी छन्, र यो विधा पाँच बलिया आर एन्ड बी प्रस्तुतिबीच सीधा प्रतिस्पर्धा हो। मतदाताहरूले १००औँ नामांकनलाई ट्रफीले चिन्ह लगाउँछन् कि लगाउँदैनन्, त्यो ७ फेब्रुअरीमा मात्र थाहा हुनेछ।</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> Grammy.com, “Who Has The Most Nominations At The 2027 Grammys?”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.grammy.com/news/who-has-the-most-grammy-nominations-at-the-2027-grammys/ ; Parade, “Beyoncé Makes Grammy History With 100th Career Nomination”, 16 November 2026 — https://parade.com/news/beyonce-makes-grammy-history-with-100th-career-nomination ; IOL, “Beyoncé makes Grammy history as first artist to reach 100 nominations”, 16 November 2026 — https://iol.co.za/entertainment/celebrity-news/2026-11-16-beyonc-makes-grammy-history-as-first-artist-to-reach-100-nominations/</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.grammy.com/news/who-has-the-most-grammy-nominations-at-the-2027-grammys/', 'https://parade.com/news/beyonce-makes-grammy-history-with-100th-career-nomination', 'https://iol.co.za/entertainment/celebrity-news/2026-11-16-beyonc-makes-grammy-history-as-first-artist-to-reach-100-nominations/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW()) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- rosalia-grammy-nominations-2027-nine-lux-20261117 (pop-music; English 651 words; Nepali 575 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'rosalia-grammy-nominations-2027-nine-lux-20261117', 'pop-music', 'Spain',
'Rosalía Earns Nine Grammy Nominations 2027 for LUX and Berghain',
'रोजालियाले LUX र Berghain का लागि २०२७ ग्र्यामीमा नौ नामांकन पाइन्',
'Rosalía earned nine nominations at the 2027 Grammy Awards, including Album of the Year for LUX, days after winning Album of the Year at the Latin Grammys.',
'रोजालियाले २०२७ ग्र्यामी अवार्डमा नौ नामांकन पाइन्, जसमा LUX का लागि एल्बम अफ द इयर पनि छ, यो ल्याटिन ग्र्यामीमा एल्बम अफ द इयर जितेको केही दिनपछि आएको हो।',
$$<p>Rosalía earned nine nominations at the 2027 Grammy Awards, the second-highest total of any artist this year, with her album <i>LUX</i> up for Album of the Year and her collaboration “Berghain” with Björk and Yves Tumor nominated for both Song of the Year and Record of the Year. The nominations, announced on Monday 16 November 2026, arrive days after <i>LUX</i> won Album of the Year at the 27th Latin Grammy Awards. <a href="https://consequence.net/2026/11/grammys-2027-nominations-list/">Consequence</a> reports that the nine nominations include her first ever nods in Album, Record and Song of the Year.</p><p>It is the biggest Grammy moment of her career. Rosalía has been one of the most acclaimed artists of the past decade, but she had never before been nominated in the three general-field categories. <i>LUX</i>, an avant-garde album on which she sings in 14 languages, changed that in a single morning.</p><h2>Rosalía Grammy nominations 2027 at a glance</h2><table><tr><th>Detail</th><th>What we know</th></tr><tr><td>Nominations</td><td>9, second only to RAYE with 11</td></tr><tr><td>Album of the Year</td><td>Lux (Complete Works)</td></tr><tr><td>Record of the Year</td><td>“Berghain”, with Björk and Yves Tumor</td></tr><tr><td>Song of the Year</td><td>“Berghain”, with Björk and Yves Tumor</td></tr><tr><td>Best Pop Solo Performance</td><td>“Sauvignon Blanc”</td></tr><tr><td>Best Alternative Music Album</td><td>Lux (Complete Works)</td></tr><tr><td>Best Alternative Music Performance</td><td>“Reliquia”</td></tr><tr><td>Latin Grammy win</td><td>Album of the Year for LUX at the 27th Latin Grammys</td></tr><tr><td>Album languages</td><td>14 languages sung across LUX</td></tr><tr><td>Ceremony</td><td>Sunday 7 February 2027, Crypto.com Arena, Los Angeles, on ABC, Disney+ and Hulu</td></tr></table><h2>What happened</h2><p>The Recording Academy announced the nominations on Monday morning, 16 November. Rosalía followed RAYE, who leads the field with 11 nominations, and sits ahead of a group on seven each, including Ella Langley, Miranda Lambert, Olivia Rodrigo and Phoebe Bridgers. Her nine nominations span the general field, pop and alternative categories, which reflects how hard <i>LUX</i> is to place in a single genre.</p><p>The week began well for her. Days before the Grammy nominations, <i>LUX</i> won Album of the Year at the Latin Grammy Awards, where Rosalía dominated the ceremony. The Grammy nominations now give the same album a second shot at the biggest prize in music, this time on the global stage.</p><h2>Why it matters</h2><p><i>LUX</i> is the most ambitious album of Rosalía career: classical structures, electronic production and vocals in 14 languages, built around a single long-form work rather than a collection of singles. The Academy nominating it for Album of the Year, and “Berghain” for both Record and Song of the Year, is a recognition that the most adventurous record of the year can also be the most honoured.</p><p>The nominations also underline how international the top of the 2027 Grammys has become. The Album of the Year field is led by a British singer, a Spanish singer and a field of American artists, and Rosalía is the only nominee whose album moves between 14 languages. A win would make her the first Spanish artist to take Album of the Year.</p><h2>How to watch</h2><p>The 69th Grammy Awards take place on Sunday 7 February 2027 at Crypto.com Arena in Los Angeles, airing live at 7 p.m. Eastern on ABC for the first time since 1972, and streaming on Disney+ and Hulu. Final-round voting runs from 10 December 2026 to 7 January 2027. Only recordings released in the United States between 31 August 2025 and 28 August 2026 were eligible.</p><h2>What is not decided yet</h2><p>No winner is decided until February, and Rosalía faces a crowded Album of the Year field that includes RAYE, Taylor Swift, Olivia Rodrigo, Phoebe Bridgers, Ella Langley, Olivia Dean and Bruno Mars. “Berghain” faces seven other songs in both Record and Song of the Year. Whether the voters reward the most experimental album of the year will be known only on the night.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> Consequence, “Grammys 2027 Nominations Revealed: Rosalía, Olivia Rodrigo, Phoebe Bridgers and RAYE Among Top Contenders”, 16 November 2026 — https://consequence.net/2026/11/grammys-2027-nominations-list/ ; Associated Press via The Indian Express, “Raye leads 2027 Grammy nominations, followed by Rosalía, Ella Langley, Olivia Rodrigo”, 16 November 2026 — https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/music/raye-leads-2027-grammy-nominations-followed-by-rosalia-ella-langley-olivia-rodrigo-10965592/ ; Reuters via GMA News, “Raye and Rosalia lead nominations for Grammys 2027”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/showbiz/showbizabroad/1009717/raye-and-rosalia-lead-nominations-for-grammys-2027/story/?just_in</p>$$,
$$<p>रोजालियाले २०२७ ग्र्यामी अवार्डमा नौ नामांकन पाइन्, जुन यो वर्ष कुनै पनि कलाकारको दोस्रो सबैभन्दा धेरै हो। उनको एल्बम <i>LUX</i> एल्बम अफ द इयरका लागि मनोनित छ भने ब्योर्क र इभ ट्युमरसँगको सहकार्य “Berghain” सङ अफ द इयर र रेकर्ड अफ द इयर दुवैका लागि मनोनित छ। सोमबार १६ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा घोषणा भएका नामांकनहरू २७औँ ल्याटिन ग्र्यामी अवार्डमा <i>LUX</i> ले एल्बम अफ द इयर जितेको केही दिनपछि आएका हुन्। <a href="https://consequence.net/2026/11/grammys-2027-nominations-list/">कन्सिक्वेन्स</a> का अनुसार यी नौ नामांकनमा एल्बम, रेकर्ड र सङ अफ द इयरमा उनका पहिलो नामांकनहरू पनि छन्।</p><p>यो उनको करियरको सबैभन्दा ठूलो ग्र्यामी क्षण हो। रोजालिया पछिल्लो दशककी सबैभन्दा प्रशंसित कलाकारमध्ये एक हुन्, तर उनी यसअघि तीनवटै सामान्य विधाका पुरस्कारका लागि कहिल्यै मनोनित भएकी थिइनन्। १४ भाषामा गाइएको अग्रगामी एल्बम <i>LUX</i> ले एउटै बिहानमा त्यो बदलिदियो।</p><h2>एक नजरमा</h2><table><tr><th>विवरण</th><th>हामीलाई के थाहा छ</th></tr><tr><td>नामांकन</td><td>९, रेयको ११ पछि दोस्रो धेरै</td></tr><tr><td>एल्बम अफ द इयर</td><td>Lux (Complete Works)</td></tr><tr><td>रेकर्ड अफ द इयर</td><td>“Berghain”, ब्योर्क र इभ ट्युमरसँग</td></tr><tr><td>सङ अफ द इयर</td><td>“Berghain”, ब्योर्क र इभ ट्युमरसँग</td></tr><tr><td>बेस्ट पप सोलो पर्फर्मेन्स</td><td>“Sauvignon Blanc”</td></tr><tr><td>बेस्ट अल्टरनेटिभ म्युजिक एल्बम</td><td>Lux (Complete Works)</td></tr><tr><td>ल्याटिन ग्र्यामी जित</td><td>२७औँ ल्याटिन ग्र्यामीमा LUX का लागि एल्बम अफ द इयर</td></tr><tr><td>एल्बमका भाषा</td><td>LUX मा १४ भाषामा गायन</td></tr><tr><td>समारोह</td><td>आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७, क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिना, लस एन्जलस, ABC, Disney+ र Hulu मा</td></tr></table><h2>के भयो</h2><p>रेकर्डिङ एकेडेमीले सोमबार बिहान १६ नोभेम्बरमा नामांकन घोषणा गर्यो। रोजालिया ११ नामांकनसहित अग्रता लिएकी रेयपछि दोस्रो स्थानमा रहिन् र ७-७ नामांकन पाएका एला ल्याङ्ली, मिरान्डा ल्याम्बर्ट, ओलिभिया रोड्रिगो र फोबी ब्रिजर्सभन्दा अगाडि रहिन्। उनका नौ नामांकन सामान्य विधा, पप र अल्टरनेटिभ विधामा फैलिएका छन्, जसले <i>LUX</i> लाई एउटै विधामा राख्न कति गाह्रो छ भन्ने देखाउँछ।</p><p>उनको हप्ता राम्रोसँग सुरु भएको थियो। ग्र्यामी नामांकनभन्दा केही दिनअघि <i>LUX</i> ले ल्याटिन ग्र्यामी अवार्डमा एल्बम अफ द इयर जितेको थियो, जहाँ रोजालियाले समारोहमा प्रभुत्व जमाएकी थिइन्। ग्र्यामी नामांकनले अब त्यही एल्बमलाई संगीतको सबैभन्दा ठूलो पुरस्कारका लागि दोस्रो मौका दिएको छ, यस पटक विश्व मञ्चमा।</p><h2>यो किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ</h2><p><i>LUX</i> रोजालियाको करियरको सबैभन्दा महत्त्वाकांक्षी एल्बम हो: शास्त्रीय संरचना, इलेक्ट्रोनिक उत्पादन र १४ भाषामा गायन, एकल गीतहरूको संग्रहभन्दा एउटै लामो स्वरूपको कामका रूपमा निर्मित। एकेडेमीले यसलाई एल्बम अफ द इयरका लागि र “Berghain” लाई रेकर्ड र सङ अफ द इयर दुवैका लागि मनोनित गर्नु भनेको वर्षको सबैभन्दा साहसी रेकर्डलाई सबैभन्दा धेरै सम्मान दिनु हो।</p><p>यी नामांकनले २०२७ ग्र्यामीको शीर्ष स्थान कति अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय भएको छ भन्ने पनि देखाउँछ। एल्बम अफ द इयरको दौडमा बेलायती गायिका, स्पेनी गायिका र अमेरिकी कलाकारहरू छन्, र रोजालिया मात्र यस्ती उम्मेदवार हुन् जसको एल्बम १४ भाषाबीच चल्छ। जितेमा उनी एल्बम अफ द इयर जित्ने पहिलो स्पेनी कलाकार बन्नेछिन्।</p><h2>कसरी हेर्ने</h2><p>६९औँ ग्र्यामी अवार्ड आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७ मा लस एन्जलसको क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिनामा हुनेछ र १९७२ पछि पहिलो पटक ABC मा प्रत्यक्ष प्रसारण हुनेछ, साथै Disney+ र Hulu मा स्ट्रिम हुनेछ। अन्तिम चरणको मतदान १० डिसेम्बर २०२६ देखि ७ जनवरी २०२७ सम्म चल्नेछ। ३१ अगस्ट २०२५ देखि २८ अगस्ट २०२६ बीच अमेरिकामा रिलिज भएका रेकर्डिङ मात्र योग्य थिए।</p><h2>के पुष्टि भएको छैन</h2><p>फेब्रुअरीसम्म कुनै विजेता तय हुँदैन, र रोजालियाले एल्बम अफ द इयरमा रेय, टेलर स्विफ्ट, ओलिभिया रोड्रिगो, फोबी ब्रिजर्स, एला ल्याङ्ली, ओलिभिया डिन र ब्रुनो मार्ससँग प्रतिस्पर्धा गर्नुपर्नेछ। “Berghain” ले रेकर्ड र सङ अफ द इयर दुवैमा सात अन्य गीतसँग प्रतिस्पर्धा गर्नेछ। मतदाताहरूले वर्षको सबैभन्दा प्रयोगात्मक एल्बमलाई पुरस्कृत गर्छन् कि गर्दैनन्, त्यो समारोहको रात मात्र थाहा हुनेछ।</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> Consequence, “Grammys 2027 Nominations Revealed: Rosalía, Olivia Rodrigo, Phoebe Bridgers and RAYE Among Top Contenders”, 16 November 2026 — https://consequence.net/2026/11/grammys-2027-nominations-list/ ; Associated Press via The Indian Express, “Raye leads 2027 Grammy nominations, followed by Rosalía, Ella Langley, Olivia Rodrigo”, 16 November 2026 — https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/music/raye-leads-2027-grammy-nominations-followed-by-rosalia-ella-langley-olivia-rodrigo-10965592/ ; Reuters via GMA News, “Raye and Rosalia lead nominations for Grammys 2027”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/showbiz/showbizabroad/1009717/raye-and-rosalia-lead-nominations-for-grammys-2027/story/?just_in</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://consequence.net/2026/11/grammys-2027-nominations-list/', 'https://indianexpress.com/article/entertainment/music/raye-leads-2027-grammy-nominations-followed-by-rosalia-ella-langley-olivia-rodrigo-10965592/', 'https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/showbiz/showbizabroad/1009717/raye-and-rosalia-lead-nominations-for-grammys-2027/story/?just_in'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW()) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- olivia-rodrigo-grammy-nominations-2027-seven-20261117 (pop-music; English 681 words; Nepali 601 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'olivia-rodrigo-grammy-nominations-2027-seven-20261117', 'pop-music', 'USA',
'Olivia Rodrigo Earns Seven Grammy Nominations 2027 for New Album and the cure',
'ओलिभिया रोड्रिगोले नयाँ एल्बम र the cure का लागि २०२७ ग्र्यामीमा सात नामांकन पाइन्',
'Olivia Rodrigo earned seven nominations at the 2027 Grammy Awards, including Album of the Year for you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love and three nominations for the cure.',
'ओलिभिया रोड्रिगोले २०२७ ग्र्यामी अवार्डमा सात नामांकन पाइन्, जसमा you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love का लागि एल्बम अफ द इयर र the cure का लागि तीन नामांकन छन्।',
$$<p>Olivia Rodrigo earned seven nominations at the 2027 Grammy Awards, including Album of the Year for her new album <i>you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love</i> and three nominations for her single “the cure”, in Record of the Year, Song of the Year and Best Pop Solo Performance. The nominations, announced on Monday 16 November 2026, put her among the most-nominated artists of the year, in a group with Ella Langley, Miranda Lambert and Phoebe Bridgers on seven each. <a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/11/16/entertainment/grammy-award-nominations-2027?cid=external-feeds_iluminar_meta">CNN</a> reports that seven of the eight Album of the Year nominees are women.</p><p>Rodrigo is a three-time Grammy winner already, and this is her second Album of the Year nomination, after <i>Guts</i> was nominated in 2024. Her new album, released inside the eligibility window, earned her a return to the biggest category, and “the cure” gives her a shot at the two biggest song prizes as well.</p><h2>Olivia Rodrigo Grammy nominations 2027 at a glance</h2><table><tr><th>Detail</th><th>What we know</th></tr><tr><td>Nominations</td><td>7, among the most-nominated artists of the year</td></tr><tr><td>Album of the Year</td><td>you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love</td></tr><tr><td>Record of the Year</td><td>“the cure”</td></tr><tr><td>Song of the Year</td><td>“the cure”</td></tr><tr><td>Best Pop Solo Performance</td><td>“the cure”</td></tr><tr><td>Best Pop Vocal Album</td><td>you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love</td></tr><tr><td>Best Rock Song</td><td>“what’s wrong with me”, with Robert Smith</td></tr><tr><td>Best Rock Performance</td><td>“what’s wrong with me”, with Robert Smith</td></tr><tr><td>Career Grammy wins</td><td>3 so far</td></tr><tr><td>Ceremony</td><td>Sunday 7 February 2027, Crypto.com Arena, Los Angeles, on ABC, Disney+ and Hulu</td></tr></table><h2>What happened</h2><p>The Recording Academy announced the nominations on Monday morning, 16 November. Rodrigo earned seven nominations in total: the album in Album of the Year and Best Pop Vocal Album, “the cure” in Record of the Year, Song of the Year and Best Pop Solo Performance, and “what’s wrong with me”, her collaboration with The Cure frontman Robert Smith, in both rock categories.</p><p>The rock nominations are the surprise of her set. Rodrigo has always been a pop artist with a rock edge, and teaming up with Robert Smith, one of the defining voices of alternative rock, gave the Academy a reason to place her in the rock field for the first time. The collaboration bridges two generations of guitar-driven songwriting, and the nominations reward that pairing.</p><h2>Why it matters</h2><p>Rodrigo is now a veteran of the Grammy process at 23, and this is her third album cycle in contention for the top prize. Her first album, <i>Sour</i>, won her Best New Artist and two other Grammys in 2022, and <i>Guts</i> was nominated for Album of the Year in 2024. A win this time would complete a run that began when she was a teenager, and would make her one of the youngest Album of the Year winners ever.</p><p>The nominations also show how the Academy now treats genre. Rodrigo appears in pop, rock and the general field in the same year, which reflects an album that refuses to stay in one lane. Her seven nominations put her level with Ella Langley, Miranda Lambert and Phoebe Bridgers, and behind only RAYE on 11 and Rosalía on nine.</p><h2>How to watch</h2><p>The 69th Grammy Awards take place on Sunday 7 February 2027 at Crypto.com Arena in Los Angeles, airing live at 7 p.m. Eastern on ABC for the first time since 1972, and streaming on Disney+ and Hulu. Final-round voting runs from 10 December 2026 to 7 January 2027. Only recordings released in the United States between 31 August 2025 and 28 August 2026 were eligible.</p><h2>What is not decided yet</h2><p>No winner is decided until February, and Rodrigo faces a crowded Album of the Year field that includes RAYE, Taylor Swift, Rosalía, Phoebe Bridgers, Ella Langley, Olivia Dean and Bruno Mars. “the cure” faces seven other songs in both Record and Song of the Year. Whether the voters choose her third album over the breakthrough years of RAYE and Rosalía will be known only on the night.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> CNN, “2027 Grammy Award nominations: See who is nominated”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.cnn.com/2026/11/16/entertainment/grammy-award-nominations-2027?cid=external-feeds_iluminar_meta ; Consequence, “Grammys 2027 Nominations Revealed: Rosalía, Olivia Rodrigo, Phoebe Bridgers and RAYE Among Top Contenders”, 16 November 2026 — https://consequence.net/2026/11/grammys-2027-nominations-list/ ; Capital FM, “Grammy nominations 2027: Who is nominated?”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.capitalfm.com/news/music/grammy-nominations-2027-major-pop-who/</p>$$,
$$<p>ओलिभिया रोड्रिगोले २०२७ ग्र्यामी अवार्डमा सात नामांकन पाइन्, जसमा उनको नयाँ एल्बम <i>you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love</i> का लागि एल्बम अफ द इयर र उनको एकल “the cure” का लागि रेकर्ड अफ द इयर, सङ अफ द इयर र बेस्ट पप सोलो पर्फर्मेन्समा तीन नामांकन छन्। सोमबार १६ नोभेम्बर २०२६ मा घोषणा भएका नामांकनले उनलाई यो वर्षका सबैभन्दा धेरै मनोनित कलाकारमध्ये एक बनाएको छ, एला ल्याङ्ली, मिरान्डा ल्याम्बर्ट र फोबी ब्रिजर्ससँग ७-७ नामांकनसहित। <a href="https://www.cnn.com/2026/11/16/entertainment/grammy-award-nominations-2027?cid=external-feeds_iluminar_meta">CNN</a> का अनुसार एल्बम अफ द इयरका आठ उम्मेदवारमध्ये सात महिला छन्।</p><p>रोड्रिगो पहिले नै तीन पटक ग्र्यामी जितेकी कलाकार हुन्, र यो उनको दोस्रो एल्बम अफ द इयर नामांकन हो, <i>Guts</i> २०२४ मा मनोनित भएपछि। योग्यता अवधिभित्र रिलिज भएको उनको नयाँ एल्बमले उनलाई सबैभन्दा ठूलो विधामा फर्कायो, र “the cure” ले उनलाई दुई ठूला गीत पुरस्कारका लागि पनि मौका दियो।</p><h2>एक नजरमा</h2><table><tr><th>विवरण</th><th>हामीलाई के थाहा छ</th></tr><tr><td>नामांकन</td><td>७, यो वर्षका सबैभन्दा धेरै मनोनित कलाकारमध्ये</td></tr><tr><td>एल्बम अफ द इयर</td><td>you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love</td></tr><tr><td>रेकर्ड अफ द इयर</td><td>“the cure”</td></tr><tr><td>सङ अफ द इयर</td><td>“the cure”</td></tr><tr><td>बेस्ट पप सोलो पर्फर्मेन्स</td><td>“the cure”</td></tr><tr><td>बेस्ट पप भोकल एल्बम</td><td>you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love</td></tr><tr><td>बेस्ट रक सङ</td><td>“what’s wrong with me”, रोबर्ट स्मिथसँग</td></tr><tr><td>बेस्ट रक पर्फर्मेन्स</td><td>“what’s wrong with me”, रोबर्ट स्मिथसँग</td></tr><tr><td>करियर ग्र्यामी जित</td><td>अहिलेसम्म ३</td></tr><tr><td>समारोह</td><td>आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७, क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिना, लस एन्जलस, ABC, Disney+ र Hulu मा</td></tr></table><h2>के भयो</h2><p>रेकर्डिङ एकेडेमीले सोमबार बिहान १६ नोभेम्बरमा नामांकन घोषणा गर्यो। रोड्रिगोले जम्मा सात नामांकन पाइन्: एल्बम अफ द इयर र बेस्ट पप भोकल एल्बममा एल्बम, रेकर्ड अफ द इयर, सङ अफ द इयर र बेस्ट पप सोलो पर्फर्मेन्समा “the cure”, र द क्योरका गायक रोबर्ट स्मिथसँगको सहकार्य “what’s wrong with me” दुवै रक विधामा।</p><p>रक नामांकनहरू उनको नामांकन सेटको आश्चर्य हो। रोड्रिगो सधैँ रक प्रभाव भएको पप कलाकार रहेकी छन्, र अल्टरनेटिभ रकका परिभाषित आवाजमध्ये एक रोबर्ट स्मिथसँग मिलेर काम गर्नाले एकेडेमीलाई उनलाई पहिलो पटक रक विधामा राख्ने कारण दियो। यो सहकार्यले गिटार-आधारित गीत लेखनका दुई पुस्तालाई जोड्छ।</p><h2>यो किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ</h2><p>रोड्रिगो २३ वर्षको उमेरमा ग्र्यामी प्रक्रियाकी अनुभवी कलाकार बनिसकेकी छन्, र यो शीर्ष पुरस्कारका लागि उनको तेस्रो एल्बम चक्र हो। उनको पहिलो एल्बम <i>Sour</i> ले २०२२ मा उनलाई बेस्ट न्यु आर्टिस्ट र दुई अन्य ग्र्यामी दिलाएको थियो, र <i>Guts</i> २०२४ मा एल्बम अफ द इयरका लागि मनोनित भएको थियो। यस पटक जितेमा उनको किशोरी उमेरमा सुरु भएको यात्रा पूरा हुनेछ, र उनी सबैभन्दा कान्छी एल्बम अफ द इयर विजेतामध्ये एक बन्नेछिन्।</p><p>यी नामांकनले एकेडेमीले अब विधालाई कसरी हेर्छ भन्ने पनि देखाउँछ। रोड्रिगो एउटै वर्षमा पप, रक र सामान्य विधामा देखा पर्छिन्, जसले एउटै बाटोमा नरहने एल्बमलाई प्रतिबिम्बित गर्छ। उनका सात नामांकनले उनलाई एला ल्याङ्ली, मिरान्डा ल्याम्बर्ट र फोबी ब्रिजर्ससँग बराबर राखेको छ, रेयको ११ र रोजालियाको नौ पछि।</p><h2>कसरी हेर्ने</h2><p>६९औँ ग्र्यामी अवार्ड आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७ मा लस एन्जलसको क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिनामा हुनेछ र १९७२ पछि पहिलो पटक ABC मा प्रत्यक्ष प्रसारण हुनेछ, साथै Disney+ र Hulu मा स्ट्रिम हुनेछ। अन्तिम चरणको मतदान १० डिसेम्बर २०२६ देखि ७ जनवरी २०२७ सम्म चल्नेछ। ३१ अगस्ट २०२५ देखि २८ अगस्ट २०२६ बीच अमेरिकामा रिलिज भएका रेकर्डिङ मात्र योग्य थिए।</p><h2>के पुष्टि भएको छैन</h2><p>फेब्रुअरीसम्म कुनै विजेता तय हुँदैन, र रोड्रिगोले एल्बम अफ द इयरमा रेय, टेलर स्विफ्ट, रोजालिया, फोबी ब्रिजर्स, एला ल्याङ्ली, ओलिभिया डिन र ब्रुनो मार्ससँग प्रतिस्पर्धा गर्नुपर्नेछ। “the cure” ले रेकर्ड र सङ अफ द इयर दुवैमा सात अन्य गीतसँग प्रतिस्पर्धा गर्नेछ। मतदाताहरूले उनको तेस्रो एल्बमलाई रेय र रोजालियाको सफल वर्षभन्दा माथि छान्छन् कि छान्दैनन्, त्यो समारोहको रात मात्र थाहा हुनेछ।</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> CNN, “2027 Grammy Award nominations: See who is nominated”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.cnn.com/2026/11/16/entertainment/grammy-award-nominations-2027?cid=external-feeds_iluminar_meta ; Consequence, “Grammys 2027 Nominations Revealed: Rosalía, Olivia Rodrigo, Phoebe Bridgers and RAYE Among Top Contenders”, 16 November 2026 — https://consequence.net/2026/11/grammys-2027-nominations-list/ ; Capital FM, “Grammy nominations 2027: Who is nominated?”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.capitalfm.com/news/music/grammy-nominations-2027-major-pop-who/</p>$$,
ARRAY['https://www.cnn.com/2026/11/16/entertainment/grammy-award-nominations-2027?cid=external-feeds_iluminar_meta', 'https://consequence.net/2026/11/grammys-2027-nominations-list/', 'https://www.capitalfm.com/news/music/grammy-nominations-2027-major-pop-who/'], NOW(), NOW(), NOW()) ON CONFLICT ("slug") DO NOTHING;

-- bruno-mars-grammy-nominations-2027-six-romantic-20261117 (pop-music; English 697 words; Nepali 616 words)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'bruno-mars-grammy-nominations-2027-six-romantic-20261117', 'pop-music', 'USA',
'Bruno Mars Earns Six Grammy Nominations 2027 for The Romantic and I Just Might',
'ब्रुनो मार्सले The Romantic र I Just Might का लागि २०२७ ग्र्यामीमा छ नामांकन पाए',
'Bruno Mars earned six nominations at the 2027 Grammy Awards, including Album of the Year for The Romantic, as the only male solo artist in the category.',
'ब्रुनो मार्सले २०२७ ग्र्यामी अवार्डमा छ नामांकन पाए, जसमा The Romantic का लागि एल्बम अफ द इयर पनि छ, उनी विधाका एक मात्र पुरुष एकल कलाकार हुन्।',
$$<p>Bruno Mars earned six nominations at the 2027 Grammy Awards, including Album of the Year for his new album <i>The Romantic</i> and Record of the Year for his single “I Just Might”. He is the only male solo artist among the eight Album of the Year nominees, in a field where seven of the eight are women. <a href="https://www.filmfare.com/news/hollywood/grammy-awards-2027-nominations-raye-taylor-swift-olivia-rodrigo-and-bruno-mars-among-top-nominees-87195.html">Filmfare</a> reports that Mars is among the top nominees of the year, with his album, single and songwriting all recognised.</p><p>Mars is one of the most decorated artists in Grammy history, with 16 wins from 31 nominations across his career, including Album of the Year for <i>24K Magic</i> in 2018. <i>The Romantic</i> is his first solo studio album in a decade, and the nominations mark his return to the top of the field after years of one-off singles and collaborations.</p><h2>Bruno Mars Grammy nominations 2027 at a glance</h2><table><tr><th>Detail</th><th>What we know</th></tr><tr><td>Nominations</td><td>6, among the top nominees of the year</td></tr><tr><td>Album of the Year</td><td>The Romantic</td></tr><tr><td>Record of the Year</td><td>“I Just Might”</td></tr><tr><td>Song of the Year</td><td>“Risk It All”</td></tr><tr><td>Best Pop Solo Performance</td><td>“I Just Might”</td></tr><tr><td>Best Pop Vocal Album</td><td>The Romantic</td></tr><tr><td>Album of the Year field</td><td>7 of 8 nominees are women; Mars is the only male solo artist</td></tr><tr><td>Career Grammy wins</td><td>16 wins from 31 nominations</td></tr><tr><td>Previous Album of the Year win</td><td>24K Magic, 2018</td></tr><tr><td>Ceremony</td><td>Sunday 7 February 2027, Crypto.com Arena, Los Angeles, on ABC, Disney+ and Hulu</td></tr></table><h2>What happened</h2><p>The Recording Academy announced the nominations on Monday morning, 16 November. Mars earned six nominations: <i>The Romantic</i> in Album of the Year and Best Pop Vocal Album, “I Just Might” in Record of the Year and Best Pop Solo Performance, and “Risk It All” in Song of the Year. The nominations put him in the top tier of the year, behind RAYE on 11, Rosalía on nine and a group on seven each.</p><p><i>The Romantic</i> is his first solo album since <i>24K Magic</i> in 2016, and it arrives after a decade in which Mars worked mainly through collaborations and singles. The album returns to the smooth R&B and funk sound that won him Album of the Year in 2018, and the nominations show the Academy still treats him as one of its favourite artists.</p><h2>Why it matters</h2><p>Mars is the only male solo artist in Album of the Year, which makes his nomination stand out in a field that is otherwise entirely women. Seven of the eight nominees are women, and the only other man in the category is a member of a group. His presence keeps the race from being a contest between women alone, and it gives the Academy a veteran campaign to weigh against the breakthrough years of RAYE, Rosalía and Ella Langley.</p><p>A win would be his second Album of the Year trophy, after <i>24K Magic</i>, and would make him one of the few artists to win the prize twice. It would also be a comeback story: a decade after his last solo album, Mars returned to the format and was rewarded with a nomination in the biggest category.</p><h2>How to watch</h2><p>The 69th Grammy Awards take place on Sunday 7 February 2027 at Crypto.com Arena in Los Angeles, airing live at 7 p.m. Eastern on ABC for the first time since 1972, and streaming on Disney+ and Hulu. Final-round voting runs from 10 December 2026 to 7 January 2027. Only recordings released in the United States between 31 August 2025 and 28 August 2026 were eligible.</p><h2>What is not decided yet</h2><p>No winner is decided until February, and Mars faces a crowded Album of the Year field that includes RAYE, Taylor Swift, Rosalía, Olivia Rodrigo, Phoebe Bridgers, Ella Langley and Olivia Dean. “I Just Might” faces seven other songs in Record of the Year, and “Risk It All” faces seven others in Song of the Year. Whether the voters reward a veteran return or a breakthrough year will be known only on the night.</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> Filmfare, “Grammy Awards 2027 Nominations: Raye, Taylor Swift, Olivia Rodrigo and Bruno Mars among top nominees”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.filmfare.com/news/hollywood/grammy-awards-2027-nominations-raye-taylor-swift-olivia-rodrigo-and-bruno-mars-among-top-nominees-87195.html ; The Economic Times, “2027 Grammy nominations: Raye leads with 11 nods; Taylor Swift, Olivia Rodrigo and Bruno Mars make the list”, 16 November 2026 — https://m.economictimes.com/magazines/panache/2027-grammy-nominations-raye-leads-with-11-nods-taylor-swift-olivia-rodrigo-and-bruno-mars-make-the-list/amp_articleshow/135894345.cms ; Consequence, “Grammys 2027 Nominations Revealed: Rosalía, Olivia Rodrigo, Phoebe Bridgers and RAYE Among Top Contenders”, 16 November 2026 — https://consequence.net/2026/11/grammys-2027-nominations-list/</p>$$,
$$<p>ब्रुनो मार्सले २०२७ ग्र्यामी अवार्डमा छ नामांकन पाए, जसमा उनको नयाँ एल्बम <i>The Romantic</i> का लागि एल्बम अफ द इयर र उनको एकल “I Just Might” का लागि रेकर्ड अफ द इयर पनि छ। एल्बम अफ द इयरका आठ उम्मेदवारमध्ये उनी एक मात्र पुरुष एकल कलाकार हुन्, जहाँ आठमध्ये सात महिला छन्। <a href="https://www.filmfare.com/news/hollywood/grammy-awards-2027-nominations-raye-taylor-swift-olivia-rodrigo-and-bruno-mars-among-top-nominees-87195.html">फिल्मफेयर</a> का अनुसार मार्स यो वर्षका शीर्ष मनोनित कलाकारमध्ये एक हुन्, उनको एल्बम, एकल र गीत लेखन सबैलाई मान्यता दिइएको छ।</p><p>मार्स ग्र्यामी इतिहासका सबैभन्दा धेरै सम्मानित कलाकारमध्ये एक हुन्, करियरमा ३१ नामांकनबाट १६ जित हासिल गरेका छन्, जसमा २०१८ मा <i>24K Magic</i> का लागि एल्बम अफ द इयर पनि छ। <i>The Romantic</i> उनको दशकपछि पहिलो एकल स्टुडियो एल्बम हो, र यी नामांकनले एकल र सहकार्यहरूमा बिताएका वर्षहरू पछि उनको शीर्ष स्थानमा फिर्ती भएको चिन्ह लगाउँछ।</p><h2>एक नजरमा</h2><table><tr><th>विवरण</th><th>हामीलाई के थाहा छ</th></tr><tr><td>नामांकन</td><td>६, यो वर्षका शीर्ष मनोनित कलाकारमध्ये</td></tr><tr><td>एल्बम अफ द इयर</td><td>The Romantic</td></tr><tr><td>रेकर्ड अफ द इयर</td><td>“I Just Might”</td></tr><tr><td>सङ अफ द इयर</td><td>“Risk It All”</td></tr><tr><td>बेस्ट पप सोलो पर्फर्मेन्स</td><td>“I Just Might”</td></tr><tr><td>बेस्ट पप भोकल एल्बम</td><td>The Romantic</td></tr><tr><td>एल्बम अफ द इयर क्षेत्र</td><td>८ मध्ये ७ उम्मेदवार महिला; मार्स मात्र पुरुष एकल कलाकार</td></tr><tr><td>करियर ग्र्यामी जित</td><td>३१ नामांकनबाट १६ जित</td></tr><tr><td>अघिल्लो एल्बम अफ द इयर जित</td><td>24K Magic, २०१८</td></tr><tr><td>समारोह</td><td>आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७, क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिना, लस एन्जलस, ABC, Disney+ र Hulu मा</td></tr></table><h2>के भयो</h2><p>रेकर्डिङ एकेडेमीले सोमबार बिहान १६ नोभेम्बरमा नामांकन घोषणा गर्यो। मार्सले छ नामांकन पाए: एल्बम अफ द इयर र बेस्ट पप भोकल एल्बममा <i>The Romantic</i>, रेकर्ड अफ द इयर र बेस्ट पप सोलो पर्फर्मेन्समा “I Just Might”, र सङ अफ द इयरमा “Risk It All”। यी नामांकनले उनलाई वर्षको शीर्ष तहमा राखेको छ, रेयको ११, रोजालियाको नौ र ७-७ नामांकन पाएका समूह पछि।</p><p><i>The Romantic</i> २०१६ को <i>24K Magic</i> पछि उनको पहिलो एकल एल्बम हो, र यो एक दशकपछि आएको छ जसमा मार्सले मुख्य रूपमा सहकार्य र एकल गीतहरूमा काम गरेका थिए। एल्बमले २०१८ मा उनलाई एल्बम अफ द इयर दिलाएको सहज आर एन्ड बी र फङ्क ध्वनिमा फर्किएको छ, र नामांकनले एकेडेमीले उनलाई अझै आफ्ना प्रिय कलाकारमध्ये एक मानेको देखाउँछ।</p><h2>यो किन महत्त्वपूर्ण छ</h2><p>मार्स एल्बम अफ द इयरका एक मात्र पुरुष एकल कलाकार हुन्, जसले उनको नामांकनलाई अन्यथा पूर्ण रूपमा महिला रहेको क्षेत्रमा अलग देखाउँछ। आठमध्ये सात उम्मेदवार महिला छन्, र विधाका अर्का एक मात्र पुरुष समूहका सदस्य हुन्। उनको उपस्थितिले दौडलाई महिलाहरूबीचको मात्र प्रतिस्पर्धा हुनबाट रोक्छ, र एकेडेमीलाई रेय, रोजालिया र एला ल्याङ्लीको सफल वर्षसँग तुलना गर्न अनुभवी अभियान दिन्छ।</p><p>जितेमा त्यो उनको दोस्रो एल्बम अफ द इयर ट्रफी हुनेछ, <i>24K Magic</i> पछि, र उनी यो पुरस्कार दुई पटक जित्ने थोरै कलाकारमध्ये एक बन्नेछन्। यो पुनरागमनको कथा पनि हुनेछ: अन्तिम एकल एल्बमको एक दशकपछि, मार्स त्यही स्वरूपमा फर्के र सबैभन्दा ठूलो विधामा नामांकन पाए।</p><h2>कसरी हेर्ने</h2><p>६९औँ ग्र्यामी अवार्ड आइतबार ७ फेब्रुअरी २०२७ मा लस एन्जलसको क्रिप्टो डट कम एरिनामा हुनेछ र १९७२ पछि पहिलो पटक ABC मा प्रत्यक्ष प्रसारण हुनेछ, साथै Disney+ र Hulu मा स्ट्रिम हुनेछ। अन्तिम चरणको मतदान १० डिसेम्बर २०२६ देखि ७ जनवरी २०२७ सम्म चल्नेछ। ३१ अगस्ट २०२५ देखि २८ अगस्ट २०२६ बीच अमेरिकामा रिलिज भएका रेकर्डिङ मात्र योग्य थिए।</p><h2>के पुष्टि भएको छैन</h2><p>फेब्रुअरीसम्म कुनै विजेता तय हुँदैन, र मार्सले एल्बम अफ द इयरमा रेय, टेलर स्विफ्ट, रोजालिया, ओलिभिया रोड्रिगो, फोबी ब्रिजर्स, एला ल्याङ्ली र ओलिभिया डिनसँग प्रतिस्पर्धा गर्नुपर्नेछ। “I Just Might” ले रेकर्ड अफ द इयरमा सात अन्य गीतसँग र “Risk It All” ले सङ अफ द इयरमा सात अन्य गीतसँग प्रतिस्पर्धा गर्नेछ। मतदाताहरूले अनुभवी फिर्तीलाई पुरस्कृत गर्छन् वा सफल वर्षलाई, त्यो समारोहको रात मात्र थाहा हुनेछ।</p><p><strong>Sources:</strong> Filmfare, “Grammy Awards 2027 Nominations: Raye, Taylor Swift, Olivia Rodrigo and Bruno Mars among top nominees”, 16 November 2026 — https://www.filmfare.com/news/hollywood/grammy-awards-2027-nominations-raye-taylor-swift-olivia-rodrigo-and-bruno-mars-among-top-nominees-87195.html ; The Economic Times, “2027 Grammy nominations: Raye leads with 11 nods; Taylor Swift, Olivia Rodrigo and Bruno Mars make the list”, 16 November 2026 — https://m.economictimes.com/magazines/panache/2027-grammy-nominations-raye-leads-with-11-nods-taylor-swift-olivia-rodrigo-and-bruno-mars-make-the-list/amp_articleshow/135894345.cms ; Consequence, “Grammys 2027 Nominations Revealed: Rosalía, Olivia Rodrigo, Phoebe Bridgers and RAYE Among Top Contenders”, 16 November 2026 — https://consequence.net/2026/11/grammys-2027-nominations-list/</p>$$,
